::PF-MCQ-01::[html]Which keyword declares a constant in the C language?
{
 =const
 ~static
 ~final
 ~let
}

::PF-MCQ-02::In Python, what is the time complexity of appending one element to a list (amortised)?
{
 =O(1)
 ~O(n)
 ~O(log n)
 ~O(n log n)
}

::PF-TF-01::In Java, a class can implement multiple interfaces.{TRUE}

::PF-TF-02::In C++, `delete` on a null pointer is undefined behaviour.{FALSE #Deleting a null pointer is a well-defined no-op.}

::PF-SA-01::What single word names the process of hiding implementation detail behind an interface?
{
 =encapsulation
 =Encapsulation
}

::PF-NUM-01::How many bits are in 4 bytes? {=32}

::PF-MISSING-WORD::A function that calls itself is called a {=recursive ~iterative ~static} function.

